<title>THAILAND: Ital-Thai 1996 net profit drops.</title>
<headline>Ital-Thai 1996 net profit drops.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		6.08	vs	     6.41</p>
<p>    Net		   1,520.51	vs	 1,601.62</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Italian-Thai Development Plc, a construction firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
